# Pin shell scripts to LF regardless of core.autocrlf.
# Why: with autocrlf=true, checkouts smudge *.sh to CRLF, which breaks bash
# ("$'\r': command not found") — this took out the .claude sprint hooks after
# a fresh checkout on 2026-06-10. Index is already LF for all tracked .sh files.
*.sh text eol=lf
